</ul>
<h2 id="key-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Key Takeaways</h2>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Point</th>
<th>Details</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Most connections succeed</td>
<td>About 70% of NAT traversal attempts achieve direct secure communication for AI agents.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
